# Tribunal "A Star is Born": Meryn Othralas in the Great Bazaar needs a stand-in
# for his lead ("looks like Tarvus", choice 1: the playscript, 10); greeting him
# with it opens the play (30). The player must stand within 100 units of the
# stage marker inside 15 s (else 150, playScript), then picks each line from a
# message box while Gureryne speaks hers: buttons 0, 2, 1, 2, 0, 1, 0 and 2,
# the authored right ones. Dravil Indrano, an assassin in the audience, then
# attacks; his death logs 50 (dravilScript). Meryn explains ("Go on." 1,
# "Continue" 5) and pays by the misses (120).
# The kill stands in for the fight. Ref FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ms_warlords --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ms_performers
run
player->PositionCell -1339 -260 93 0 "Mournhold, Great Bazaar"
until 600 "meryn othralas"->GetDistance player < 400
talk meryn othralas
ask its own drama
ask looks like Tarvus
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex MS_Performers == 10
bye
talk meryn othralas
expect GetJournalIndex MS_Performers == 30
bye
run
player->PositionCell -1689 -30 116 0 "Mournhold, Great Bazaar"
button 0
button 2
button 1
button 2
button 0
button 1
button 0
button 2
defend
until 300 "dravil indrano"->GetDisabled == 0
console 06851A54.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex MS_Performers == 50
run
player->PositionCell -1339 -260 93 0 "Mournhold, Great Bazaar"
until 600 "meryn othralas"->GetDistance player < 400
talk meryn othralas
ask assassin would attack
choose 1
choose 5
expect GetJournalIndex MS_Performers == 120
expect "meryn othralas".missCounter == 0
bye
end
